│       catches netaddr.AddrFormatError for validation errors. Python's standard library 
│       ipaddress module (available since Python 3.3) provides ipaddress.IPv4Network, 
│       ipaddress.IPv6Network, and ipaddress.IPNetwork with similar functionality and 
│       raises ValueError/AddressValueError for invalid formats. This is a genuine 
│       functional overlap for the IP address handling in InetAddressFormField and 
│       CidrAddressFormField.
